# ==============================================================================
# Dhriti Repomix Ignore — Excludes Snapshots, Secrets, Dumps, Binaries & Caches
# ==============================================================================

# 1. Repomix Snapshots & Outputs (Prevent recursive duplicate copies)
*repomix*
dhrithi-repomix.md
repomix-output.*
repomix.config.json

# 2. Personal & Sensitive Files (Never bundle into prompts)
*cookie*.txt
www.youtube.com_cookies.txt
brave_cookies_temp*
bridge_token*
*.token
.env*
daemon.lock

# 3. Large Raw Data Dumps & Databases
watch_later.json
liked_videos.json
bookmarks_corpus.json
*playlist*.json
*.sqlite3*
*.sqlite
*.db

# 4. Media & Binary Assets
dashboard/gallery/
dashboard/fonts/
docs/*.png
docs/*.jpg
docs/*.jpeg
*.png
*.jpg
*.jpeg
*.webp
*.gif
*.ico
*.ttf
*.woff
*.woff2
*.onnx

# 5. Git, Caches & Dependencies
.git/
.github/
.cache/
models/
__pycache__/
*.py[cod]
*$py.class
*.egg-info/
build/
dist/
.pytest_cache/
.coverage
htmlcov/
.tox/
node_modules/
venv/
.venv/
env/

# 6. Windows & OS Noise
.DS_Store
Thumbs.db
desktop.ini
*.lnk
